  "summary": "<p>Trump Accounts—tax-advantaged investment accounts for kids—are a game-changing tool designed to help every American child build savings and a stronger financial future. With automatic enrollment now complete, the Trump Administration has made it easier than ever for families to participate and give their children a jump-start on the American Dream. Nearly 70 million Trump Accounts [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/10/a-financial-stake-in-the-future-for-nearly-70-million-american-children-trump-accounts-made-it-possible/\">Trump Accounts Put 70 Million Kids on the Path to Financial Freedom</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
